      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَاغِلٌ</span></b>  One <i>who seeks,</i> or <i>desires, to do evil,</i> or
<i>mischief, to his companions, when they think that
he desires to do them good.</i> (T, TA. [See the
next paragraph.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَغِلٌ</span>.

